<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Batch4countries-Argentina"><strong>A=
rgentina</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 103=
.167%;">
<thead>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Identifiers</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Descriptions</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Regex</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 13.6801%;">
<col style=3D"width: 26.0396%;">
<col style=3D"width: 52.16%;">
<col style=3D"width: 8.12029%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff" style=3D"text-align: left;"><p title=3D"">Social Security Number</p></t=
h>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#36b37e confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#36b3=
7e" style=3D"text-align: left;" title=3D"Background color : Medium green 10=
0%"><p title=3D""><strong>National ID Number</strong></p></th>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">Documento Nacional d=
e Identidad<span style=3D"color: rgb(32,33,34);"> - </span>DNI</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff" style=3D"text-align: left;">Central Provident Fund Number - CPF</th>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2" style=3D"text-align: left;">Passport Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">Argent=
ina Passport Number matches a valid passport number combined with any of th=
e following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: identificaci=C3=B3n pa=
ra viajes internacionales, detalles del pasaporte, visa, documento nacional=
 de identidad, n=C3=BAmero de pasaporte, documento de viaje, autoridad emis=
ora, prueba de identificaci=C3=B3n, ID de pasaporte, n.=C2=B0 de pasaporte,=
 identificaci=C3=B3n (or) pasaporte. <span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">=
(All terms case insensitive.)<span>&nbsp;</span>(All terms case insensitive=
; diacritics are optional.)</span></td>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">([A-z]{3}[- ]?\d{3}[=
- ]?\d{3}|\d{8}[- ]?[A-z])</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:identificaci[=
=C3=B3o]n para viajes internacionales|detalles del pasaporte|visa|documento=
 nacional de identidad|n[=C3=BAu]mero de pasaporte|documento de viaje|autor=
idad emisora|prueba de identificaci[=C3=B3o]n|ID de pasaporte|n.[=C2=B0o] d=
e pasaporte|identificaci[=C3=B3o]n|pasaporte)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$)=
)</td>
</tr>
