wspan=3D"2" style=3D"text-align: left;">Driver's License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">Argent=
ina Driver's License Number matches a valid license number combined with an=
y of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: licencia de tar=
jeta con foto, licencia estudiante, titulares de licencia, titular de licen=
cia, n=C3=BAmero de licencia, licencias de conducir, licencia de conducir (=
or) licencia del conductor.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);"><span>&nbs=
p;</span></span><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">(All terms case insen=
sitive; diacritics are optional.)</span></td>
