wspan=3D"2" style=3D"text-align: left;">Phone Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">Argent=
ina Phone Number matches a valid phone number combined with any of the foll=
owing keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de tel=C3=A9fono=
, n=C3=BAmero de m=C3=B3vil (or) n=C3=BAmero de tel=C3=A9fono m=C3=B3vil.<s=
pan style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=
=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">(All terms case insensitive; diacritics are opti=
onal.)</span></td>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>((\+?54)?[ ]?(9)?=
[ ]?)((11|22[013]|23[067]|249|26[01346]|280|29[14789]|336|34[12358]|35[138]=
|36[24]|37[069]|38[013578]|2202|222[13-79]|224[1-6]|225[2457]|226[124-8]|22=
6[24-8]|227[1-4]|228[13-6]|228[3-6]|229[1267]|2302|231[467]|232[03-6]|233[1=
3-8]|234[2-6]|235[2-8]|239[2-6]|247[34578]|262[2456]|264[678]|265[125-8]|29=
0[123]|292[0-9]|293[1-6]|294[02568]|295[234]|296[2346]|2972|298[23]|332[79]=
|338[2578]|340[0124-9]|343[5-8]|344[24-7]|345[4568]|346[02-9]|347[126]|348[=
2379]|349[123678]|352[1245]|353[237]|354[1-46-9]|356[234]|357[1-6]|358[2-5]=
|371[1568]|372[15]|373[145]|374[13]|375[14-8]|377[2-57]|378[126]|382[1567]|=
383[2578]|384[13-6]|385[4-8]|386[1235789]|387[3678]|388[5-8]|389[124]) ?(15=
)? ?(\d{2,4}\-?\d{4}))</p></td>
