yle=3D"text-align: left;"><strong>Zipcode</strong></th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">Argent=
ina Zipcode matches a valid zipcode combined with any of the following keyw=
ords within a proximity of 10 terms: direcci=C3=B3n, distrito de c=C3=B3dig=
o postal, =C3=A1rea de c=C3=B3digo postal, unidad de c=C3=B3digo postal (or=
) sector de c=C3=B3digo postal. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are=
 optional.)</td>
