</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Licens=
e Plate Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">Argent=
ina License Plate Number matches a valid license plate number combined with=
 any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: n.=C2=B0 de =
registro, n.=C2=B0 de matr=C3=ADcula, n=C3=BAmero de licencia, n=C3=BAmero =
de matr=C3=ADcula, matr=C3=ADcula (or) n=C3=BAmero de registro.<span style=
=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=3D"color: =
rgb(23,43,77);">(All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</spa=
n></td>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:([A-z]{2}[ .-]?[\=
d]{3}[ .-]?[A-z]{2})|([A-hJ-nP-z]{1,2}[ .-]?[\d]{1,7})|([A-z]{3}[ .-]?[\d]{=
3}))</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n.[=C2=B0o] d=
e registro|n.[=C2=B0o] de matr[=C3=ADi]cula|n[=C3=BAu]mero de licencia|n[=
=C3=BAu]mero de matr[=C3=ADi]cula|matr[=C3=ADi]cula|n[=C3=BAu]mero de regis=
tro)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
