ina Bank Account Number matches a valid bank account number combined with a=
ny of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de=
 cuenta bancaria, detalles bancarios, n=C3=BAmero de banco, c=C3=B3digo de =
cuenta, ID de cuenta, n=C3=BAmero de cuenta (or) cuenta numerada.<span styl=
e=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=3D"color:=
 rgb(23,43,77);">(All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</sp=
an></td>
