<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Cyprus License Plate Number matche=
s a valid license plate number combined with any of the following keywords =
within a proximity of 10 terms: =CE=B1=CF=81. =CE=BA=CE=B1=CF=84=CE=B1=CF=
