=CE=B7=CF=82, ta=C5=9F=C4=B1t plakas=C4=B1, tescil no., plaka no., plaka nu=
maras=C4=B1, plaka (or) tescil numaras=C4=B1.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,4=
