<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Bank Account Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Cyprus Bank Account Number matches=
 a valid bank account number combined with any of the following keywords wi=
thin a proximity of 10 terms: =CE=B1=CF=81=CE=B9=CE=B8=CE=BC=CF=8C=CF=82 =
=CF=84=CF=81=CE=B1=CF=80=CE=B5=CE=B6=CE=B9=CE=BA=CE=BF=CF=8D =CE=BB=CE=BF=
=CE=B3=CE=B1=CF=81=CE=B9=CE=B1=CF=83=CE=BC=CE=BF=CF=8D, =CF=83=CF=84=CE=BF=
=CE=B9=CF=87=CE=B5=CE=AF=CE=B1 =CF=84=CF=81=CE=AC=CF=80=CE=B5=CE=B6=CE=B1=
=CF=82, =CE=B1=CF=81=CE=B9=CE=B8=CE=BC=CF=8C=CF=82 =CF=84=CF=81=CE=AC=CF=80=
=CE=B5=CE=B6=CE=B1=CF=82, =CE=BA=CF=89=CE=B4=CE=B9=CE=BA=CF=8C=CF=82 =CE=BB=
=CE=BF=CE=B3=CE=B1=CF=81=CE=B9=CE=B1=CF=83=CE=BC=CE=BF=CF=8D, =CE=B1=CE=BD=
=CE=B1=CE=B3=CE=BD=CF=89=CF=81=CE=B9=CF=83=CF=84=CE=B9=CE=BA=CF=8C =CE=BB=
