<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Routing Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Cyprus Routing Number matches a va=
lid routing number combined with any of the following keywords within a pro=
ximity of 10 terms: =CE=B1=CF=81=CE=B9=CE=B8=CE=BC=CF=8C=CF=82 =CE=B4=CF=81=
=CE=BF=CE=BC=CE=BF=CE=BB=CF=8C=CE=B3=CE=B7=CF=83=CE=B7=CF=82, #=CF=84=CF=81=
=CE=B1=CF=80=CE=B5=CE=B6=CE=B9=CE=BA=CE=AE=CF=82 =CE=B4=CF=81=CE=BF=CE=BC=
=CE=BF=CE=BB=CF=8C=CE=B3=CE=B7=CF=83=CE=B7=CF=82, =CF=84=CF=81=CE=B1=CF=80=
=CE=B5=CE=B6=CE=B9=CE=BA=CE=AE=CF=82 =CE=B4=CF=81=CE=BF=CE=BC=CE=BF=CE=BB=
=CF=8C=CE=B3=CE=B7=CF=83=CE=B7=CF=82, =CF=84=CF=81=CE=B1=CF=80=CE=B5=CE=B6=
=CE=B9=CE=BA=CE=AE =CE=B4=CF=81=CE=BF=CE=BC=CE=BF=CE=BB=CF=8C=CE=B3=CE=B7=
=CF=83=CE=B7, # =CE=B4=CF=81=CE=BF=CE=BC=CE=BF=CE=BB=CF=8C=CE=B3=CE=B7=CF=
=83=CE=B7=CF=82, #=CE=B4=CF=81=CE=BF=CE=BC=CE=BF=CE=BB=CF=8C=CE=B3=CE=B7=CF=
=83=CE=B7=CF=82, =CE=B1=CF=81. =CE=B4=CF=81=CE=BF=CE=BC=CE=BF=CE=BB=CF=8C=
=CE=B3=CE=B7=CF=83=CE=B7=CF=82, y=C3=B6nlendirme numaras=C4=B1, banka y=C3=
=B6nlendirme no, banka y=C3=B6nlendirme, y=C3=B6nlendirme no., y=C3=B6nlend=
irme#, y=C3=B6nlendirme#, y=C3=B6n. no. (or) RTN.<span style=3D"color: rgb(=
23,43,77);"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);"=
>(All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(324)\d{6}</td>
