<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Batch4countries-Ecuador"><strong>Ecu=
ador</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 100=
.0%;">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 21.4448%;">
<col style=3D"width: 37.3015%;">
<col style=3D"width: 32.0924%;">
<col style=3D"width: 9.16135%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Identifiers</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Descriptions</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Regex</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Social Security Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">National ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Ecuador National ID Number matches=
 a valid National Identity Card Number combined with any of the following k=
eywords within a proximity of 10 terms: NIN =C2=BFn=C3=BAmero, NIN, n=C3=BA=
mero de tarjeta nacional, n=C3=BAmero de identificaci=C3=B3n nacional, n=C3=
=BAmero de tarjeta de identidad nacional (or) identificaci=C3=B3n nacional.=
 (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{9}[ -]?\d</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:NIN \=C2=BF(n[=C3=BAu]mero)?|n[=C3=BAu]me=
ro de tarjeta nacional|n[=C3=BAu]mero de identificaci[=C3=B3o]n nacional|n[=
=C3=BAu]mero de tarjeta de identidad nacional|identificaci[=C3=B3o]n nacion=
al)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">178455996-4</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Central Provident Fund Number - CPF</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Passport Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Ecuador Passport Number matches a =
valid passport number combined with any of the following keywords within a =
proximity of 10 terms: identificaci=C3=B3n para viajes internacionales, det=
alles del pasaporte, visa, documento nacional de identidad, n=C3=BAmero de =
pasaporte, documento de viaje, autoridad emisora, prueba de identificaci=C3=
=B3n, ID de pasaporte, n.=C2=B0 de pasaporte (or) identificaci=C3=B3n, pasa=
porte.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span=
 style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">(All terms case insensitive; diacritics ar=
e optional.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{10}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:identificaci[=C3=B3o]n para viajes intern=
acionales|detalles del pasaporte|visa|documento nacional de identidad|n[=C3=
=BAu]mero de pasaporte|documento de viaje|autoridad emisora|prueba de ident=
ificaci[=C3=B3o]n|ID de pasaporte|n.[=C2=B0o] de pasaporte|identificaci[=C3=
=B3o]n|pasaporte)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">1234567890</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Driver's License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Ecuador Driver's License Number ma=
tches a valid license number combined with any of the following keywords wi=
thin a proximity of 10 terms: licencia de tarjeta con foto, licencia estudi=
ante, titulares de licencia, titular de licencia, n=C3=BAmero de licencia, =
licencias de conducir, licencia de conducir (or) licencia del conductor.</t=
d>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">([A-Z]{1,2})?(\d{9}[- ]?\d|\d{8,10})</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:licencia de tarjeta con foto|licencia est=
udiante|titulares de licencia|titular de licencia|n[=C3=BAu]mero de licenci=
a|licencias de conducir|licencia de conducir|licencia del conductor)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">AA171560116, <span style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);">=
AA171560116-2</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Social Insurance Number - SIN</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Tax ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Ecuador Tax ID Number matches a va=
lid Tax Identification Number combined with any of the following keywords w=
ithin a proximity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de identificaci=C3=B3n fiscal, n=
=C3=BAmero de identidad fiscal, c=C3=B3digo de identificaci=C3=B3n fiscal, =
archivo fiscal, n.=C2=B0 de identificaci=C3=B3n fiscal, n.=C2=B0 fiscal, n=
=C3=BAmero de registro fiscal, n.=C2=B0 de ID fiscal, n=C3=BAmero fiscal, n=
=C3=BAmero de ID fiscal, ID del NIF, n.=C2=B0 del NIF, NIF (or) ID fiscal.<=
span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=
=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">(All terms case insensitive; diacritics are opti=
onal.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>(?:(0|1|2)[0-9]|3[0])[. -]?[0-9][. -]?\d{6,7}=
[. -]?(001)</p></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de identificaci[=C3=B3o]n =
fiscal|n[=C3=BAu]mero de identidad fiscal|c[=C3=B3o]digo de identificaci[=
=C3=B3o]n fiscal|archivo fiscal|n.[=C2=B0o] de identificaci[=C3=B3o]n fisca=
l|n.[=C2=B0o] fiscal|n[=C3=BAu]mero de registro fiscal|n.[=C2=B0o] de ID fi=
scal|n[=C3=BAu]mero fiscal|n[=C3=BAu]mero de ID fiscal|ID del NIF|n.[=C2=B0=
o] del NIF|NIF|ID fiscal)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
