<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey">VA=
T ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Ecuador VAT ID Number - RUC (Regis=
tro =C3=9Anico del Contribuyente) matches a valid RUC number combined with =
