{3}</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">RUC</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>RUC</strong></td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n.[=C2=B0o] de IVA|n[=C3=BA=
u]mero de IVA|n[=C3=BAu]mero de impuesto sobre el valor agregado|impuesto s=
obre el valor agregado|IVA)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
