<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Batch4countries-Indonesia"><strong>I=
ndonesia</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 100=
.0%;">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 14.436%;">
<col style=3D"width: 37.3466%;">
<col style=3D"width: 40.9702%;">
<col style=3D"width: 7.24722%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Identifiers</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Descriptions</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Regex</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Social Security Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#36b37e confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#36b3=
7e" title=3D"Background color : Medium green 100%">National ID Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Central Provident Fund Number - CPF</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#36b37e confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#36b3=
7e">Passport Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#ffab00 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffab=
00" rowspan=3D"2">Driver's License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Indonesia Driver's License Number =
matches a valid license number combined with any of the following keywords =
within a proximity of 10 terms: SIM, surat izin mengemudi kendaraan bermoto=
r, surat izin mengemudi kendaraan, izin mengemudi, surat mengemudi, surat i=
zin mengemudi (or) surat izin berkendara. (All terms case insensitive.)</td=
>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">((\d{4}[-]?\d{2}(0[1-9]|1[0-2])[-]?\d{6})|(([A-Z=
])[-]?\d{4}[-]?\d{2}(0[1-9]|1[0-2])[-]?\d{5})|(\d{4}[-]?\d{2}(0[1-9]|1[0-2]=
)[-]?\d{5})|(\d{2}(0[1-9]|1[0-2])\d{8})|(\d{6}(0[1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[01])(0[1-=
9]|1[0-2])\d{6}))</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:SIM|surat izin mengemudi kendaraan bermot=
or|surat izin mengemudi kendaraan|izin mengemudi|surat mengemudi|surat izin=
 mengemudi|surat izin berkendara)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">960212345678, 75061305-290291, 1127-6312-000091<=
/td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Social Insurance Number - SIN</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#ffab00 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffab=
00" rowspan=3D"2">Tax ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Indonesia Tax ID Number matches a =
valid Tax Identification Number combined with any of the following keywords=
 within a proximity of 10 terms: Nomor pendaftaran wajib pajak, Nomor wajib=
 pajak, nomor identifikasi pajak, nomor identitas pajak, nomor pajak, kode =
identifikasi pajak, file pajak, no identifikasi pajak, no pajak, nomor regi=
strasi pajak, nomor id pajak, nomoridpajak, id pajak, idpajak, noidpajak, n=
omorpajak, nopajak, id npwp, no npwp, npwp, NPWP, NIN, SIM, Nomor KTP, No K=
TP, Nomor Induk Kependudukan, NIK, no kartu tanda penduduk, nomor identifik=
asi nasional, nomor kartu tanda penduduk (or) id nasional. (All terms case =
insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(\d{16}|(\d{6}[ -]?(0[1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[01]|(40))=
(0[1-9]|1[0-2])(\d{2})[ -]?\d{3,4}))</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:Nomor pendaftaran wajib pajak|Nomor wajib=
 pajak|nomor identifikasi pajak|nomor identitas pajak|nomor pajak|kode iden=
tifikasi pajak|file pajak|no identifikasi pajak|no pajak\\#?|nomor registra=
si pajak|nomor id pajak|nomoridpajak\\#?|id pajak|idpajak\\#?|noidpajak\\#?=
|nomorpajak\\#?|nopajak\\#?|id npwp|no npwp|npwp\\#?|NPWPNIN\\#?|SIM|Nomor =
KTP|No KTP|Nomor Induk Kependudukan|NIK|no kartu tanda penduduk|nomor ident=
ifikasi nasional|nomor kartu tanda penduduk|id nasional)(?:\\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#=
])(?=3D\\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">0345347869=
001000, 3171010102990800</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#ffab00 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffab=
00" rowspan=3D"2">VAT ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Indonesia VAT ID Number matches a =
valid value added tax identification number combined with any of the follow=
ing keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: no. ppn, nomor ppn, nomor paja=
k pertambahan nilai, pajak pertambahan nilai, no ppn, ppn# (or) PPN. (All t=
erms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">\d{2}\.\d{=
3}\.\d{3}\.\d{1}[-]\d{3}\.\d{3}</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:no. ppn|nomor ppn|nomor pajak pertambahan=
 nilai|pajak pertambahan nilai|no ppn|ppn\#?|PPN)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\=
W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">02.271.824=
.1-413.000</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Health Service Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Health Insurance Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey">Da=
te of Birth</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#ffab00 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffab=
00" rowspan=3D"2">Phone Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Indonesia Phone Number matches a v=
alid phone number combined with any of the following keywords within a prox=
imity of 10 terms: nomor telepon, no. telepon, no telp, nomor ponsel, Nomor=
 hand phone, No hp, nomor hp, nomor telfon, nomor hp, nomor handphone (or) =
nomor whatsapp. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">((\+)?((62|0)[- ]?)?(81[1-9]|82[1-378]|83[1-38]|=
85[1-9]|87[78]|88[1-9]|89[5-9]|(21))[ -]?(\d{4})[- ]?\d{3,5})</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:nomor telepon|no. telepon|no telp|nomor p=
onsel|Nomor hand phone|No hp|nomor hp)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">62 8111234123</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#de350b confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#de35=
0b">Physical Address</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#ffab00 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffab=
00" rowspan=3D"2">Postcode</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Indonesia Postcode matches a valid=
 postcode combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of=
 10 terms: alamat, distrik kode pos, area kode pos, unit kode pos, sektor k=
ode pos, address, postcode (or) kode pos. (All terms case insensitive.)</td=
>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">\d{5}</spa=
n></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:alamat|distrik kode pos|area kode pos|uni=
t kode pos|sektor kode pos|address|postcode|kode pos)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">55892</spa=
n></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">License Plate Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Indonesia License Plate Number mat=
ches a valid license plate number combined with any of the following keywor=
ds within a proximity of 10 terms: no. registrasi, no. plat, nomor surat iz=
in, nomor plat surat izin, plat surat izin, Nomor plat, Plat nomor (or) nom=
or registrasi. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>[A-Z]{1,2}[ ]?[1-9]\d{3}[ ]?[A-Z]{2,3}</p></t=
d>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:no. registrasi|no. plat|nomor surat izin|=
nomor plat surat izin|plat surat izin|Nomor plat|Plat nomor|nomor registras=
i)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">A 1234 ABC</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#de350b confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#de35=
0b">Person Name</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">International Bank Account Number - IBAN</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Bank Account Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Indonesia Bank Account Number matc=
hes a valid bank account number combined with any of the following keywords=
 within a proximity of 10 terms: nomor rekening bank, detail bank, nomor ba=
nk, kode rekening, id rekening, nomor rekening, Nomor akun bank (or) rekeni=
ng bernomor. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{8,16}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:nomor rekening bank|detail bank|nomor ban=
k|kode rekening|id rekening|nomor rekening|Nomor akun bank|rekening bernomo=
r)</td>
