<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);">Clearing Code=
</span></th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Indonesia Clearing Code matches a =
valid clearing code combined with any of the following keywords within a pr=
oximity of 10 terms: nomor perutean, perutean bank#, perutean bank, no peru=
tean, perutean #, perutean#, perutean, kode ngresiki, Nomor kode bank, Clea=
ring Code (or) RTN. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{7}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Routing Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:nomor perutean|perutean bank\#?|no perute=
an|perutean \#?|perutean\#?|kode ngresiki|Nomor kode bank|Clearing Code|RTN=
)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
