></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Nomor Induk Berusaha (NIB)</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Indonesia Business Number - NIB (N=
omor Induk Berusaha) matches a valid NIB combined with any of the following=
 keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: NIB, nomor bisnis, nb#, nb, ID bi=
snis, idbisnis#, idbisnis, nobisnis#, nobisnis, Nomor Induk Perusahaan, Nom=
or perusahaan, Nomor Induk Berusaha (or) no bisniss. (All terms case insens=
itive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{13}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Business Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:NIB|nomor bisnis|nb\#?|ID bisnis|idbisnis=
\#?|nobisnis\#?|Nomor Induk Perusahaan|Nomor perusahaan|Nomor Induk Berusah=
a|no bisnis)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">1234567890123</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Company Number</th>
