<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Passport Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">New Zealand Passport Number matche=
s a valid passport number combined with any of the following keywords withi=
n a proximity of 10 terms: identification for international travel, passpor=
t details, visa, national identity card, passport number, travel document, =
issuing authority, proof of identification, passportid, passportno., identi=
fication (or) passport.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All ter=
ms case insensitive.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-z]{2}\d{6,7}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:identification for internat=
ional travel|passport details|visa|national identity card|passport number|t=
ravel document|issuing authority|proof of identification|passportid|passpor=
tno.|identification|passport)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">RA000750</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Driver's License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">New Zealand Driver's License Numbe=
r matches a valid license number combined with any of the following keyword=
s within a proximity of 10 terms: photocard licence, learner drivers, licen=
ce holders, licence holder, licence number, license number, driving licence=
s, driving licenses, driving licence, driving license, driver's licence (or=
) driver's license.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All terms c=
ase insensitive.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-z]{2}\d{6,7}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:photocard licence|learner d=
rivers|licence holders|licence holder|licence number|license number|driving=
 licences|driving licenses|driving licence|driving license|driver'?s licenc=
e|driver'?s license)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">DM123456</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Social Insurance Number - SIN</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Tax ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">New Zealand Tax ID Number matches =
a valid Tax Identification Number combined with any of the following keywor=
ds within a proximity of 10 terms: tax identification number, tax identity =
number, tax number, tax identification code, tax file, tax identification n=
o, tax no#, tax no, tax registration number, tax id number, tax id, taxid#,=
 taxid, taxidno#, taxidno, taxidnumber#, taxidnumber, taxno#, taxno, taxnum=
ber#, taxnumber, tin id, tin no, tin# (or) TIN.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23=
,43,77);">&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[0-1]?[0-9]{2}[- ][0-9]{3}[- ][0-9]{3}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:tax identification number|t=
ax identity number|tax number|tax identification code|tax file|tax identifi=
cation no|tax no\#?|tax no|tax registration number|tax id number|taxidnumbe=
r\#?|taxid\#?|taxidno\#?|taxno\#?|taxnumber\#?|tin id|tin no|tin\#?|TIN|tax=
 id)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">099-999-999</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">VAT ID Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Health Service Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">New Zealand Health Service Number =
matches a valid health service number combined with any of the following ke=
ywords within a proximity of 10 terms: personal health number, health servi=
ce no, Health Service Number, patient information (or) speciality services.=
<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive.)</=
span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">([A-HJ-NP-Z|a-z]{3}[- ]?\d{4}|[A-HJ-NP-Z|a-z]{3}=
[- ]?\d{2,3}[- ]?[A-HJ-NP-Z|a-z]{1,2})</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:personal health number|heal=
th service no|Health Service Number|patient information|speciality services=
)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ACK12DV, ACP1235</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Health Insurance Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#36b37e confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#36b3=
7e">Date of Birth</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Phone Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">New Zealand Phone Number matches a=
 valid phone number combined with any of the following keywords within a pr=
oximity of 10 terms: mobile phone number, mobilephone number, mobile phone =
no., mobilephone no., mobile number, mobilenumber, mobile no., mobileno., m=
obile, contact number, contact no., contact, fax number, fax no., cell phon=
e number, cellphone number, cell phone no., cellphone no., cell phone, cell=
phone, cell number, cellnumber, cell no., cellno., whatsapp number, whatsap=
p no., whatsapp, phone number, phone no., phone num, telephonic number, tel=
ephone number, telephone no., telephone, landline number, landline no. (or)=
 landline num. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(0508|0800|0900)[ -]?\d{5,8}|(?:0|\+64)?[ -]?\d{=
1}[ -]?\d{3}[ -]?\d{4}|(03|04|06|07|09)[ -]?\d{7}|(021|022|025|027|028|029)=
[ -]?\d{6,8}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:mobile[ ]?phone number|mobi=
le[ ]?phone no.|mobile[ ]?number|mobile[ ]?no.|mobile|contact number|contac=
t no.|contact|fax number|fax no.|cell[ ]?phone number|cell[ ]?phone no.|cel=
l[ ]?phone|cell[ ]?number|cell[ ]?no.|whatsapp number|whatsapp no.|whatsapp=
|phone number|phone no.|phone num|telephonic number|telephone number|teleph=
one no.|telephone|landline number|landline no.|landline num)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D=
[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
