<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Postcode</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">New Zealand Postcode matches a val=
id postcode combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity =
of 10 terms: address, postcode district, postcode area, postcode unit, post=
code sector (or) postcode.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All =
terms case insensitive.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{4}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:address|postcode district|p=
ostcode area|postcode unit|postcode sector|postcode)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">4414</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">License Plate Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">New Zealand License Plate Number m=
atches a valid license plate number combined with any of the following keyw=
ords within a proximity of 10 terms: registration. no., plate. no., license=
 number, license plate number, licence plate (or) registration number.<span=
 style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive.)</span>=
</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">((\d{3}[A-z]\d)|(\d{2}[A-z]\d{2})|(\d[A-z]\d{3})=
|([A-z]\d{3}[A-z])|([A-z]\d[A-z]{3}))</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:registration. no.|plate. no=
.|license number|license plate number|licence plate|registration number)(?:=
\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">&nbsp;A2ATL</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#de350b confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#de35=
0b">Person Name</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
