tches a valid bank account number combined with any of the following keywor=
ds within a proximity of 10 terms: bank account number, bank details, bank =
number, account code, account id, account number (or) numbered account.<spa=
n style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive.)</span=
