s a valid business number combined with any of the following keywords withi=
n a proximity of 10 terms: business no, business number, bn#, bn, business =
ID, businessid#, businessid, businessno# (or) businessno.<span style=3D"col=
or: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive.)</span></td>
