<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Batch4countries-Nigeria"><strong>Nig=
eria</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 100=
.0%;">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 22.1754%;">
<col style=3D"width: 35.0439%;">
<col style=3D"width: 31.3938%;">
<col style=3D"width: 11.3869%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Identifiers</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Descriptions</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Regex</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Social Security Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">National ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Nigeria National ID Number matches=
 a valid National Identity Card Number combined with any of the following k=
eywords within a proximity of 10 terms: NIN#, NIN, national identity card n=
umber, national card number, national card no, national identification numb=
er (or) national id. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:\d{4}[ -]?\d{4}[ -]?\d{4}[ -]?\d{4}|\d{4}[ -]=
?\d{3}[ -]?\d{4})</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:NIN\#?|national identity card number|nati=
onal card number|national card no|national identification number|national i=
d)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">5412 7512 3478 3456, 3456 291 7521</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Central Provident Fund Number - CPF</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Passport Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Nigeria Passport Number matches a =
valid passport number combined with any of the following keywords within a =
proximity of 10 terms: identification for international travel, passport de=
tails, visa, national identity card, passport number, travel document, issu=
ing authority, proof of identification, passportid, passportno., identifica=
tion (or) passport.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All terms c=
ase insensitive.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z]{1,2}\d{7,8}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:identification for international travel|p=
assport details|visa|national identity card|passport number|travel document=
|issuing authority|proof of identification|passportid|passportno.|identific=
ation|passport)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">A10567902</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Driver's License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Nigeria Driver's License Number ma=
tches a valid license number combined with any of the following keywords wi=
thin a proximity of 10 terms: photocard licence, learner drivers, licence h=
olders, licence holder, licence number, license number, driving licences, d=
riving licenses, driving licence, driving license, driver's licence, driver=
s licence, driver's license (or) drivers license.<span style=3D"color: rgb(=
23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-z]{3}[ -]?[A-Z0-9]{6,12}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:photocard licence|learner drivers|licence=
 holders|licence holder|licence number|license number|driving licences|driv=
ing licenses|driving licence|driving license|driver'?s licence|driver'?s li=
cense)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
