wspan=3D"2">Social Insurance Number - SIN</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Nigeria Social Insurance Number - =
SIN matches a valid social insurance number combined with any of the follow=
ing keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: sin#, sin, Social Insurance Nu=
mber, social insurance no, social insurance, social ins (or) soc ins.<span =
style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive.)</span><=
/td>
