<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2"><p>Social Security Number</p></th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Philippines Social Security Number=
 matches a valid SSN combined with any of the following keywords within a p=
roximity of 10 terms: social security number, social security no#, social s=
ecurity no, social security#, social security, SSN#, SSN (or) SSID.<span st=
yle=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive.)</span></t=
d>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(\d{2,4}[- ]\d{7}[- ]\d{1}|\d{3}[- ]\d{3}[- ]\d{=
3}[- ]\d{3})</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:social security number|soci=
al security no\#?|social security\#?|SSN\#?|SSID)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\=
W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
