<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Passport Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Philippines Passport Number matche=
s a valid passport number combined with any of the following keywords withi=
n a proximity of 10 terms: identification for international travel, passpor=
t details, visa, national identity card, passport number, travel document, =
issuing authority, proof of identification, passportid, passportno., identi=
fication (or) passport.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All ter=
ms case insensitive.)</span></td>
