<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Philippines Tax ID Number matches =
a valid Tax Identification Number combined with any of the following keywor=
ds within a proximity of 10 terms: tax identification number, tax identity =
number, tax number, tax identification code, tax file, tax identification n=
o, tax no#, tax no, tax registration number, tax id number, taxidnumber#, t=
axidnumber, taxidno#, taxidno, taxid#, taxid, taxno#, taxno, taxnumber#, ta=
xnumber, tax id, tin id, tin no, tin# (or) TIN.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23=
,43,77);">&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:\d{3}[ -]?\d{3}[ -]?\d{3}[ -]?\d{3}[A-z]|\d{3=
