cation no|tax no\#?|tax no|tax registration number|tax id number|taxidnumbe=
r\#?|taxidno\#?|taxid\#?|taxno\#?|taxnumber\#?|tax id|tin id|tin no|tin\#?|=
TIN)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
