<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Philippines Postcode matches a val=
id postcode combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity =
of 10 terms: address, postcode district, postcode area, postcode unit, post=
code sector (or) postcode.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All =
terms case insensitive.)</span></td>
