<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#f4f5f7 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5=
f7" rowspan=3D"2">National ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">South Africa National ID Number ma=
tches a valid National Identity Card Number combined with any of the follow=
ing keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: NIN#, NIN, national identity c=
ard number, national card number, national card no, national identification=
 number (or) national id. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:\d{2}(?:(0[1-9]|[1][0-2])[- \/\.]?(0[1-9]|[12=
][0-9]|3[01])[- \/\.]?\d{4}(0|1)(8|9)\d)|\d{2}(0[1-9]|[1][0-2])(0[1-9]|[12]=
[0-9]|3[01])[- \/\.]?[0-9]{4}[- \/\.]?(0|1|2)\d)</td>
