rt details, visa, national identity card, passport number, travel document,=
 issuing authority, proof of identification, passportid, passportno., ident=
ification (or) passport.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All te=
rms case insensitive.)</span></td>
