<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey">Cr=
edit Card Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Routing Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">South Africa Routing Number matche=
s a valid routing number combined with any of the following keywords within=
 a proximity of 10 terms: routing number, bank routing#, bank routing, rout=
ing #, routing no (or) RTN. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{9}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:routing number|bank routing=
\#?|routing \#?|routing no|RTN)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">081205112</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Business Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Company Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">South Africa Company Number matche=
s a valid company number combined with any of the following keywords within=
 a proximity of 10 terms: company no#, company no, company registration num=
ber, company number, corporate identification number (or) corporate number.=
<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive.)</=
span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{5}[- \/\.]\d{2}[- \/\.]\d{2}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:company no\#?|company regis=
tration number|company number|corporate identification number|corporate num=
ber)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">12345/28/14</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Batch4countries-Taiwan"><strong>Taiw=
an</strong></h2>
