<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Social Security Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">National ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Taiwan National ID Number matches =
a valid National Identity Card Number combined with any of the following ke=
ywords within a proximity of 10 terms: NIN#, =E8=BA=AB=E5=88=86=E8=AD=89=E8=
=99=9F=E7=A2=BC, =E8=BA=AB=E5=88=86=E8=AD=89=E8=99=9F, =E5=9C=8B=E6=B0=91=
=E8=BA=AB=E5=88=86=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC, =E5=9C=8B=E6=B0=91=E8=BA=AB=E5=88=86=
=E8=AD=89=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC (or) =E5=9C=8B=E6=B0=91=E8=BA=AB=E5=88=86=E8=AD=
=89. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-z][12]\d{8}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:NIN\#?|=E8=BA=AB=E5=88=86=
=E8=AD=89=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC|=E8=BA=AB=E5=88=86=E8=AD=89=E8=99=9F|=E5=9C=8B=
=E6=B0=91=E8=BA=AB=E5=88=86=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC|=E5=9C=8B=E6=B0=91=E8=BA=AB=
=E5=88=86=E8=AD=89=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC|=E5=9C=8B=E6=B0=91=E8=BA=AB=E5=88=86=
=E8=AD=89)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">A112345678</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Central Provident Fund Number - CPF</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#36b37e confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#36b3=
7e">Passport Number</th>
