<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Driver's License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Taiwan Driver's License Number mat=
ches a valid license number combined with any of the following keywords wit=
hin a proximity of 10 terms: =E9=99=84=E7=85=A7=E7=89=87=E4=B9=8B=E5=8D=A1=
=E5=BC=8F=E9=A7=95=E7=85=A7, =E5=AD=B8=E7=BF=92=E9=A7=95=E9=A7=9B, =E9=A7=
=95=E7=85=A7=E6=8C=81=E6=9C=89=E4=BA=BA, =E9=A7=95=E7=85=A7=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=
=BC, =E9=A7=95=E7=85=A7=E7=B7=A8=E8=99=9F, =E9=A7=95=E7=85=A7, =E9=A7=95=E7=
=85=A7, =E9=A7=95=E7=85=A7, =E9=A7=95=E7=85=A7 (or) =E9=A7=95=E9=A7=9B=E5=
=9F=B7=E7=85=A7.</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z]\d{9}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:=E9=99=84=E7=85=A7=E7=89=87=
=E4=B9=8B=E5=8D=A1=E5=BC=8F=E9=A7=95=E7=85=A7|=E5=AD=B8=E7=BF=92=E9=A7=95=
=E9=A7=9B|=E9=A7=95=E7=85=A7=E6=8C=81=E6=9C=89=E4=BA=BA|=E9=A7=95=E7=85=A7=
=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC|=E9=A7=95=E7=85=A7=E7=B7=A8=E8=99=9F|=E9=A7=95=E7=85=A7|=
=E9=A7=95=E9=A7=9B=E5=9F=B7=E7=85=A7)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">A123456789</td>
</tr>
