<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Taiwan VAT ID Number matches a val=
id value added tax identification number combined with any of the following=
 keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: vat =E7=B7=A8=E8=99=9F, vat =E8=
=99=9F=E7=A2=BC, =E5=8A=A0=E5=80=BC=E7=A8=85=E7=B7=A8=E8=99=9F, =E5=8A=A0=
=E5=80=BC=E7=A8=85, vat =E8=99=9F, vat# (or) VAT. (All terms case insensiti=
ve.)</td>
