<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Taiwan Phone Number matches a vali=
d phone number combined with any of the following keywords within a proximi=
ty of 10 terms: =E9=9B=BB=E8=A9=B1=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC, =E9=9B=BB=E8=A9=B1, =
=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC, =E8=A1=8C=E5=8B=95=E9=9B=BB=E8=A9=B1=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC =
(or) =E6=89=8B=E6=A9=9F=E9=9B=BB=E8=A9=B1=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC.</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(\+?886)?[ ]?(((0?0[256789])|0?((19)|(37)|(49)|(=
8[23])6?|(89)))[ ]?\d{4}[-]?\d{4})</td>
