<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Taiwan Postcode matches a valid po=
stcode combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10=
 terms: =E5=9C=B0=E5=9D=80, =E9=83=B5=E5=8D=80, =E9=83=B5=E5=9F=9F, =E9=83=
=B5=E9=81=9E=E5=8D=80=E8=99=9F=E5=96=AE=E4=BD=8D, =E9=83=B5=E9=81=9E=E5=8D=
=80=E8=99=9F=E9=83=A8=E9=96=80 (or) =E9=83=B5=E9=81=9E=E5=8D=80=E8=99=9F.</=
td>
