 a valid bank account number combined with any of the following keywords wi=
thin a proximity of 10 terms: =E9=8A=80=E8=A1=8C=E5=B8=B3=E6=88=B6=E8=99=9F=
=E7=A2=BC, =E9=8A=80=E8=A1=8C=E8=A9=B3=E7=B4=B0=E8=B3=87=E8=A8=8A, =E9=8A=
=80=E8=A1=8C=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC, =E5=B8=B3=E6=88=B6=E4=BB=A3=E7=A2=BC, =E5=
=B8=B3=E6=88=B6=E8=AD=98=E5=88=A5=E7=A2=BC, =E5=B8=B3=E8=99=9F (or) =E7=B7=
=A8=E8=99=9F=E5=B8=B3=E6=88=B6.</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{14}</td>
