ximity of 10 terms: =E9=8A=80=E8=A1=8C=E5=8C=AF=E6=AC=BE=E4=BB=A3=E8=99=9F,=
 =E9=8A=80=E8=A1=8C=E5=8C=AF=E6=AC=BE#, =E9=8A=80=E8=A1=8C=E5=8C=AF=E6=AC=
=BE, =E5=8C=AF=E6=AC=BE #, =E5=8C=AF=E6=AC=BE#, =E5=8C=AF=E6=AC=BE=E4=BB=A3=
=E8=99=9F (or) RTN.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;(All terms c=
