tizen ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Vietnam National ID Number - CIN (=
Citizen ID Number) matches a valid CCN combined with any of the following k=
eywords within a proximity of 10 terms: NIN#, NIN, s=E1=BB=91 c=C4=83n c=C6=
=B0=E1=BB=9Bc c=C3=B4ng d=C3=A2n, s=E1=BB=91 c=C4=83n c=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Bc, s=
=E1=BB=91 ch=E1=BB=A9ng minh th=C6=B0, s=E1=BB=91 th=E1=BA=BB c=C4=83n c=C6=
=B0=E1=BB=9Bc c=C3=B4ng d=C3=A2n (or) c=C4=83n c=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Bc c=C3=B4ng =
d=C3=A2n. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
